2869
00:46:19,620 --> 00:46:20,100
Why?

2870
00:46:20,100 --> 00:46:30,880
Because Mary's action becomes for us the ideal response, the perfect demonstration of what discipleship to Jesus looks like.

2871
00:46:31,280 --> 00:46:35,560
A life rooted in sacrificial worship and totally surrendered to God's agenda.

2872
00:46:35,560 --> 00:46:38,500
