2873
00:46:38,500 --> 00:46:49,100
Jesus notes that she is preparing him for burial, indicating that she fully identifies herself and all that she has with the death of Jesus.

2874
00:46:49,100 --> 00:46:54,580
By doing so, she not only takes her place with other commendable characters in Mark's gospel,

2875
00:46:54,700 --> 00:46:58,700
but she stands as the supreme example of ideal discipleship.

2876
00:46:58,700 --> 00:47:03,840
The supreme example of ideal discipleship.

2877
00:47:03,840 --> 00:47:11,320
She publicly identifies with Jesus and his death at great personal cost and without reservation in the hope of resurrection.

2878
00:47:11,320 --> 00:47:16,500
My main point for this morning, the one thing that I want you to not forget, this is it.

2879
00:47:16,500 --> 00:47:23,260
Discipleship to Jesus that lasts is rooted in sacrificial worship and is totally surrendered to God's agenda.

2880
00:47:23,900 --> 00:47:30,920
This is why Jesus wants everybody that hears the gospel to hear the story of Mary, because she gets it.

2881
00:47:30,920 --> 00:47:33,500
