2882
00:47:33,500 --> 00:47:42,960
Christ's intended response to the gospel of Jesus is total surrender to his agenda above our own.

2883
00:47:42,960 --> 00:47:44,480
It's allegiance to him as Lord.

2884
00:47:44,480 --> 00:47:50,640
It's trusting that his plans and purposes for our life are far better for us than our own.

