2903
00:49:01,560 --> 00:49:05,400
There's this thing called the Proust effect.

2904
00:49:05,400 --> 00:49:07,120
Anybody heard of it?

2905
00:49:07,120 --> 00:49:12,060
It is a sudden or vivid memory triggered by scent.

2906
